{'symbol': 'WY', 'date': '2022-01-28 03:10:00', 'title': 'WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY DECLARES SUPPLEMENTAL DIVIDEND ON COMMON SHARES', 'text': 'SEATTLE , JAN. 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY\xa0(NYSE: WY) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A SUPPLEMENTAL DIVIDEND OF\xa0$1.45\xa0PER SHARE ON THE COMMON STOCK OF THE COMPANY, PAYABLE IN CASH ON\xa0FEBRUARY 28, 2022, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD OF SUCH COMMON STOCK AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0FEBRUARY 18, 2022. IN 2021, WEYERHAEUSER GENERATED ADJUSTED FUNDS AVAILABLE FOR DISTRIBUTION (ADJUSTED FAD) OF MORE THAN $2.6 BILLION.'}{'symbol': 'WY', 'date': '2022-01-28 03:05:00', 'title': 'WEYERHAEUSER REPORTS FOURTH QUARTER, RECORD FULL YEAR RESULTS', 'text': 'SEATTLE, JAN. 28, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY (NYSE: WY) TODAY REPORTED FOURTH QUARTER NET EARNINGS OF\xa0$416 MILLION, OR 55 CENTS\xa0PER DILUTED SHARE, ON NET SALES OF $2.2 BILLION. THIS COMPARES WITH NET EARNINGS OF $292 MILLION, OR 39 CENTS\xa0PER DILUTED SHARE, ON NET SALES OF $2.1 BILLION\xa0FOR THE SAME PERIOD LAST YEAR AND NET EARNINGS OF $482 MILLION FOR THE THIRD QUARTER OF 2021.'}